1 REM FBCS ECMA-0087
2 REM CLAIM A-ECMA-32
3 REM TYPE SELF
4 REM TEMPLATE: 3 OF NUMERIC*E is valid syntax, usable via WITH <line> (ANSI 11.3.2 N22 l.7445).
100 PRINT "ECMA-0087 TEMPLATE WITH NUMERIC*E FIELDS IS ACCEPTED (11.3.2 N22 l.7445)"
110 OPEN #1: NAME "ECMA0087.DAT", ACCESS OUTIN, ORGANIZATION SEQUENTIAL, RECTYPE NATIVE
120 TEMPLATE: 3 OF NUMERIC*E
130 WRITE #1, WITH 120: 1.5, 2.5, 3.5
140 SET #1: POINTER BEGIN
150 READ #1, WITH 120: X, Y, Z
160 IF X = 1.5 AND Y = 2.5 AND Z = 3.5 THEN PRINT "*** TEST PASSED ***" ELSE PRINT "*** TEST FAILED ***"
170 CLOSE #1
180 END
